The stable patch changes xilinx_spi_find_buffer_size(), which does not exist in this ADI driver. ADI reads xlnx,fifo-depth from the device tree and uses that value directly. Retain the entire ADI file; applying the stable hunk to its IRQ handler would corrupt unrelated code.
